  "method": [
    "Five current source snapshots; test-only exact builtin feature/probe-init replacements and20 optional-ISA helper-entry counters. Stored full reversible patches/diffs recover every original source byte.",
    "Runtime noinline environment stub reads SIRKIT_QA_FEATURES, including before global Wavelet feature initializers. No -march=native; fixture rejects pre-defined AVX2/POPCNT compile targets.",
    "Actual host AVX2/POPCNT support is checked before positive helper execution. All tested host reports were mask3.",
    "8builds: GCC15.2/Clang21 ×checked/SKIP ×SIMD enabled/disabled.16enabled feature-mask runs plus4disabled runs requesting both features.",
    "Every run asserts below/above threshold counter deltas, values against independent oracles, final none-feature zero optional helper entries, and selected-feature positive counts. Disabled runs assert zero helper/probe/init calls;10 library/compiler preprocessing checks assert instrumented helper/probe call absence.",
    "Subprocess pause/ack checked before each compiler/execution/version/preprocessor child. All correctness runs pinned CPU8. No formal/shared/frozen previous artifacts changed."
  ],
  "oracles": {
    "NTT": "Direct modular DFT for small lengths, inverse roundtrip and naive modular convolution; transform8/16/32, output15/16, direct/NTT boundary32/33. Includes non-Montgomery modulus with no SIMD expected.",
    "Matrix": "Independent uint64 product→uint32 accumulation reference; column15/16, left63/64, K64/65, B262144/exceed, output-row tails and32-column tails; validates full accumulator vs tiled helper selection. Clang correctly has no Matrix dedicated helper.",
    "Wavelet": "Sorted subranges and direct counts/access for uint16/32/64,int64, extrema, empty/uniform, word63/64/65 and construction127/128/129, all public queried extrema/rank/kth/pred/succ operations. Separately asserts POPCNT/build helper selections.",
    "Floyd": "Independent per-source Dijkstra for nonnegative graphs and ordered-DAG DP for negative edges; dense/sparse/disconnected, n7/8/15/16/31/32/63/64/65, with/without path restoration and path-cost checks.",
    "Eratosthenes": "Independent trial division up to40000; scalar/SIMD3968/3969 and carry-reduction word boundaries, prime_count/is_prime/enumeration."
  },
