    "Counters cover20 named optional-ISA entries and guarded CPU probes; compiler baseline instructions/auto-vectorization and uninstrumented standard-library internals are not counted.",
    "Positive tests execute only on actual supported host ISA. No native-target build, runtime unsupported hardware, sanitizer campaign or exhaustive input-domain proof is claimed.",
    "Disabled preprocessor checks remove branch code, while none-feature runtime tests retain optional helper definitions and exercise false guards."
